    <grid>
      <Value><![CDATA[{
  "name": "1 column layout",
  "sections": [
    {
      "grid": "12",
      "rows": [
        {
          "name": "Article Full",
          "id": "309e2d4b-2d7d-4f87-ba89-b73f65ff57bf",
          "areas": [
            {
              "grid": "12",
              "controls": [
                {
                  "value": "<p><em>The Roadlab Mossel Bay team is currently helping reconstruct and widen of a major bridge near George.</em></p>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": "rte"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                },
                {
                  "value": {
                    "focalPoint": {
                      "left": 0.5,
                      "top": 0.5
                    },
                    "id": 1809,
                    "udi": "umb://media/df7a9fb94cc943828142e63bf399c3b9",
                    "image": "/media/x4phvx4j/4.jpeg"
                  },
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "media",
                    "view": "media"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                },
                {
                  "value": "<p> </p>\n<p>The Roadlab team in Mossel Bay is contributing to the reconstruction and widening of a three span arch bridge on the R102 in George.</p>\n<p>The existing road structure and pavement layers are being widened to include a shoulder on each lane, requiring the reconstruction of the approaching pavement layers, road structure and road surface.</p>\n<p>Our team will be conducting all soil, concrete and asphalt acceptance control testing on behalf of SNA Civil &amp; Structural Engineers.</p>\n<p>Once our work is done, the newly constructed bridge will have a dual carriage way with 3.2m lane width and 2.0m shoulder on each side, reducing the high accident risk owing to the narrow lane width crossing the bridge.<br /><br /></p>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": "rte"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                }
              ],
              "styles": null,
              "config": null
            }
          ],
          "styles": null,
          "config": null
        },
        {
          "name": "Article Split",
          "id": "9a192af1-f10b-45cf-a8d1-d36f4098f5f6",
