                {
                  "value": "<p> </p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Concrete testing</strong><br />Compressive strength<br />Durability of concrete<br />Concrete mix design analysis<br /><br /><strong>Asphalt testing<br /></strong>Asphalt mix design analysis<br />Asphalt, Marshall testing/analysis<br />Core drilling and compaction analysis</p>\n<hr />\n<p> </p>",
